{{!
	Notion skin: the site identity block - logo icon, wordmark and tagline.

	Rendered from Header.mustache inside a data-logos section, so the current context
	is core's logo definition (LogoOptions, assembled by SkinComponentLogo through
	ResourceLoader SkinModule::getAvailableLogos) while the surrounding skin data is
	reached through the Mustache context stack.

	LogoDefinition logo
	string link-mainpage link to the main page (from SkinMustache in core)
	string|null icon path to the square site icon, when the wiki configures one
	object|null wordmark the wordmark image, when the wiki configures one
		string src path to the wordmark image
		string style intrinsic size, computed by core as a width and height in em (T207789)
	object|null tagline the tagline image, when the wiki configures one
		string src path to the tagline image
		string width intrinsic width of the tagline image in pixels
		string height intrinsic height of the tagline image in pixels
		string style intrinsic size, computed by core as a width and height in em (T207789)
	string msg-sitetitle the contents of the sitetitle message key
	string msg-sitesubtitle the contents of the sitesubtitle message key

	The class surface below is entirely core-owned, and it includes the inversion hook
	that lets the wordmark flip correctly under the dark palette, so every class name
	is part of the public content contract. This partial therefore renames nothing:
	the Notion appearance is supplied entirely by the skin's components/Logo.less,
	which the style entry point imports under `@media all` so the logo is styled on
	screen and in print alike.
}}
<a href="{{link-mainpage}}" class="mw-logo">
	{{#icon}}
	{{! alt is provided for valid HTML but given aria-hidden not needed. }}
	<img class="mw-logo-icon" src="{{.}}" alt="" aria-hidden="true" height="50" width="50">
	{{/icon}}
	<span class="mw-logo-container skin-invert">
		{{#wordmark}}
		{{!-- djlint:off H006 --}}
		<img class="mw-logo-wordmark" alt="{{msg-sitetitle}}" src="{{src}}" style="{{style}}">
		{{!-- djlint:on H006 --}}
		{{/wordmark}}
		{{^wordmark}}
		<strong class="mw-logo-wordmark">{{msg-sitetitle}}</strong>
		{{/wordmark}}
		{{#tagline}}
		<img class="mw-logo-tagline" alt="{{msg-sitesubtitle}}" src="{{src}}" width="{{width}}" height="{{height}}" style="{{style}}">
		{{/tagline}}
	</span>
</a>
